{"name": "Blueground", "description": "<p><strong>Blueground</strong> is a global proptech company that is reinventing the way people live!</p>\n<p>With its curated network of thousands of quality, turnkey homes in sought-after neighborhoods around the globe, Blueground is accessible for stays of a month or longer. Our tech-enabled platform provides a fully digitized experience with around-the-clock support and access to daily necessities like apartment cleanings, grocery delivery, wellness offerings, and more, providing a seamless experience from end to end.</p>\n<p>At Blueground, our mission is to make people feel at home wherever they choose to live. We give guests peace of mind, flexibility &amp; the confidence they need to explore life\u2019s next adventure. Our team, known as the BeeGees, shares this spirit. We foster a culture of curiosity, connection, and growth. We empower each BeeGee to make an impact, championing a workplace where innovation thrives, careers flourish, and every individual is supported in shaping their own journey.</p>\n<p>Blueground is headquartered in New York City, with a portfolio of thousands of apartments in 46+ cities and 17 countries worldwide.  </p>\n<p>Find us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Instagram, Twitter, TikTok or at www.theblueground.com.</p>", "jobs": [{"title": "Client Experience Coordinator (English & Greek Speaker) - Talent Pool", "shortcode": "186545F8C1", "code": null, "employment_type": "Full-time", "telecommuting": false, "department": "Shared Services", "url": "https://apply.workable.com/j/186545F8C1", "shortlink": "https://apply.workable.com/j/186545F8C1", "application_url": "https://apply.workable.com/j/186545F8C1/apply", "published_on": "2026-02-12", "created_at": "2025-09-30", "country": "Greece", "city": "Athens", "state": "Attica", "education": null, "experience": "Associate", "function": "Customer Service", "industry": "Real Estate", "locations": [{"country": "Greece", "countryCode": "GR", "city": "Athens", "region